# slop quarantine — throwaway verification code, never shipped
slop/*
!slop/README.md
.claude/
# Local agent configuration is personal to whoever is working, not a project
# convention: plugin choices, skills and worktrees differ per machine and per
# person. It also has no contributor value here — the gate is `pnpm gate` and
# that is documented in AGENTS.md and the README. Keeping it out avoids a
# public repo describing a private workspace, which is how a hardcoded path
# into a checkout beside this one reached this tree once already.
.agents/evidence/
